{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality?  Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career!<br><br>Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers.  Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "", "text": "People who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer.\n<br><br>\nChocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!", "id": 2, "time": "19500"}, {"image": "", "text": "People who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counsellor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.<br><br>I know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs?  Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much.  I really appreciate it!", "id": 3, "time": "38000"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le17ob07re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": ""}, {"image": "", "text": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality?  Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career! Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers.  Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!", "id": 1, "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "text": "People who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer.  Chocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!", "id": 2, "time": "18400"}, {"image": "", "text": "People who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counselor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.", "id": 3, "time": "34000"}, {"image": "", "text": "I know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs?  Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much.  I really appreciate it!", "id": 4, "time": "43600"}]}}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "static", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality? Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career! Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers. Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!<br><br>\nPeople who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer. Chocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!\nPeople who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counsellor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.<br><br>\nI know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs? Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much. I