content": " Think about being a software developer.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "counsellor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who helps others make important decisions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should train to become a counsellor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "risk-taker ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is not afraid of doing things that are not certain  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People who like vanilla ice cream are actually risk-takers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "entrepreneur ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who starts his or her own business", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "engineer", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person trained in the construction of buildings, bridges, roads, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: If you are logical and thoughtful, think about being an engineer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "software developer", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a person who creates computer programs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People who like math make good software developers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "nurse ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who assists medical doctors", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Being a nurse requires a patient personality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Ask 5 people their favorite ice cream between these choices: vanilla, chocolate, strawberry, chocolate chip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain what type of person that makes them, based on Sally's article.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain what kind of job they should have, according to Sally.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them if they think this information is true.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph to explain the results of your study.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph to the class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I ask people about their favorite ice cream.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about people's personality and jobs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the results of the study.", "type": "text"}]}]}